          <h4>Production Operations Oversight</h4>
          <p>Monitor production volumes, allocations, and decline curves with real-time dashboards.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="use-case-card">
          <div class="use-case-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div>
